1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,300
(Sheldon-bot:)No, you can't.

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:05,640
(Leonard:)Wait.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,010
(Sheldon-bot:)Come back.

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,290
(Sheldon-bot:)Halt.

5
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:11,680
(Sheldon-bot:)Authorized personnel only!

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,170
(Penny:)So, either one
of you weirdos

7
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:17,170
(Penny:)want to buy my underwear?
Only 1,400 bucks.

8
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,660
(Scene:)Sheldon,
this is ridiculous.

9
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,230
(Sheldon:)I'm behind you.

10
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:28,450
(Sheldon:)Please look at me when
you're talking to me.

11
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,950
(Leonard:)I am looking at you.

12
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:31,230
(Sheldon:)No, you're not.

13
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:33,700
(Sheldon:)Pay no attention to
that man in the bed.

14
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,000
(Leonard:)You cannot exist

15
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,760
(Leonard:)as a virtual presence.

16
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,620
(Leonard:)Not here
and certainly not at work.

17
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:40,490
(Leonard:)Oh, good God.

18
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,060
(Sheldon:)At my age,
do you know

19
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,910
(Sheldon:)how I'm statistically
most likely to die?

20
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,200
(Leonard:)At the hands of your roommate?

21
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,770
(Sheldon:)An accident.

22
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:51,240
(Leonard:)That's how I'm going
to make it look.

23
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,870
(Sheldon:)Until I can transfer
my intellect

24
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:55,170
(Sheldon:)to a more durable container,

25
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,940
(Sheldon:)my body will remain
safely ensconced in my bed.

26
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)Fine, but don't expect my help.

